language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

contract MachineContract.
interface MachineInterface.
message-set MachineRequests.
message-set MachineResponses.

MachineInterface follows MachineContract.
MachineContract allows MachineRequests.
MachineContract specifies "Independent per-client subscriptions; family-specific delivery policies. Results and snapshots route to requester, observations to subscribed clients. Normal Machine data cannot expose simulator hidden truth.".
MachineContract status inherited.
MachineContract allows MachineResponses.
MachineContract schema "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/contracts/proto/mvp1/machine/v1/machine.proto".
MachineRequests member "mvp1.machine.v1.MachineClientMessage".
MachineResponses member "mvp1.machine.v1.MachineServerMessage".
